### busybox double bracket glob match
# shellcheck shell=busybox
image=$1
[[ $image == *alpine* ]] && echo "alpine based"
>>> SC2330 3:14

### busybox double bracket not equals glob
# shellcheck shell=busybox
[[ "$1" != /tmp/* ]] && echo outside
>>> SC2330 2:12

### bash double bracket glob is fine
#!/bin/bash
[[ $1 == *alpine* ]] && echo "alpine based"
>>> none

### busybox literal right side is fine
# shellcheck shell=busybox
[[ "$1" == alpine ]] && echo exact
>>> none

### busybox lone expansion is reported as SC2053 instead
